summary: 'Single session, audit → shipped: a mega-audit spree surfaced v7, designed the keystone, adversarially reviewed it (caught 3 false claims pre-build), then built the entire v7.0 keystone across 7 rounds on branch v7-close-the-loop — Spine, Front Door, emission, settlement/learning, Cid''s captain board, symbol self-documentation, and a Paradigm University course (PARA 801). All rounds tested, lore''d, changelog''d, committed, and pushed. The framework''s ''self-improving'' claim is now falsifiable instead of asserted.'
